  <Translations>
    <Translation Language="en-US">The practice can't see your record yet: your permission is missing. You give it when you check in.</Translation>
    <Translation Language="es-CO">El consultorio todavía no puede ver tu historia: falta tu permiso. Lo das en tu pre-registro.</Translation>
